s://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"subscribed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2022-06-24T22:30:40Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1167408671","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12582#issuecomment-1167408671","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/12582","id":1167408671,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc5FlT4f","user":{"login":"Huqicheng","id":31775227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzc1MjI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31775227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng","html_url":"https://github.com/Huqicheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2022-06-27T14:14:04Z","updated_at":"2022-06-27T14:16:52Z","body":"## Failed part:\n\nTEST_F(TabletSplitSingleServerITest, MaxFileSizeTTLTabletOnlyValidForManualSplit)\n\n../../src/yb/integration-tests/tablet-split-itest.cc:2002\nValue of: ts_desc->get_disable_tablet_split_if_default_ttl()\n  Actual: false\nExpected: true\n\n## Analysis\n\n```\n  // If the \"max file size for compaction\" flag is greater than 0, then tablet splitting should\n  // be disabled for tablets with a default TTL.\n  metrics->set_disable_tablet_split_if_default_ttl(FLAGS_rocksdb_max_file_size_for_compaction > 0);\n```\n\nFrom the test\n```\nANNOTATE_UNPROTECTED_WRITE(FLAGS_rocksdb_max_file_size_for_compaction) = 100_KB;\n```\n\nFrom log:\n\n1. Initially “W0627 03:04:49.097231  6159 tserver_metrics_heartbeat_data_provider.cc:124] FLAGS_rocksdb_max_file_size_for_compaction: 0”\n\n2. Then “W0627 03:04:54.368522  6159 tserver_metrics_heartbeat_data_provider.cc:124] FLAGS_rocksdb_max_file_size_for_compaction: 102400”\n\nIn normal case, in step 1, the uptime calculated should be 0, however, if there is a delay before sending the heartbeat, yb-master should set the uptime to greater than 0 into ts-desc. \n\n## reproduce\n\nTo simulate this, let heartbeater sleep 10s before sending heartbeat,\n\n```\nI0627 13:58:51.088091 12209 tserver_metrics_heartbeat_data_provider.cc:122] jonathan uptime_seconds 10\nI0627 13:58:51.088166 12209 tserver_metrics_heartbeat_data_provider.cc:126] jonathan FLAGS_rocksdb_max_file_size_for_compaction 0\nI0627 13:58:51.090945 12178 ts_manager.cc:140] Registered new tablet server { permanent_uuid: \"5bcaa763104f4bdd91b98fb2c8cc0597\" instance_seqno: 1656338320562334 start_time_us: 1656338320562334 } with Master, full list: [{5bcaa763104f4bdd91b98fb2c8cc0597, 0x0000000005910a18 -> { permanent_uuid: 5bcaa763104f4bdd91b98fb2c8cc0597 registration: common { private_rpc_addresses { host: \"127.0.0.2\" port: 21727 } http_addresses { host: \"127.0.0.2\" port: 26762 } cloud_info { placement_cloud: \"cloud1\" placement_region: \"rack1\" placement_zone: \"zone\" } placement_uuid: \"\" broadcast_addresses { host: \"127.0.0.3.ip.yugabyte\" port: 21727 } pg_port: 5433 } capabilities: 2189743739 capabilities: 1427296937 capabilities: 2980225056 placement_id: cloud1:rack1:zone }}]\nI0627 13:58:51.091225 12154 mini_cluster.cc:625] 1 TS(s) registered with Master after 10.5097s\nI0627 13:58:51.091495 12178 ts_descriptor.cc:298] jonathan uptime 10\n```\n\nSince the second heartbeat also will wait for 10s, but the uptime is already greater than 0, the test case can resume but disable_tablet_split_if_default_ttl is not correct as expected by the test case.\n\n## Solution\n\nWe should modify the test case, not only wait for uptime > 0 but also wait for disable_tablet_split_if_default_ttl to be true. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1167408671/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Huqicheng","id":31775227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzc1MjI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31775227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng","html_url":"https://github.com/Huqicheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":6935092644,"node_id":"REFE_lADOBlCVUc5KCke6zwAAAAGdXR2k","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/events/6935092644","actor":{"login":"Huqicheng","id":31775227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzc1MjI3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31775227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Huqicheng","html_url":"https://github.com/Huqicheng","followers_url":"https://api.git